        "synopsis": {
            "value": "Tang Xin is a workaholic who doesn’t believe in marriage, until a heroic military officer Wu Si saves her after a ship explosion. Though fate keeps them apart, they reconnect on a blind date and slowly fall in love.\n\nAt the same time, Lan Yang Yang, a new medical graduate, falls for officer Zong Qing. Faced with the challenges of loving a soldier, both women begin to question their choices.\n\nBut through\n\nthe strength of the military community, they come to embrace a resilient, unwavering love. Together with their partners, they step confidently into the future, as life and love continue within the barracks.",
